{"id":61,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"سَبَّحَ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَمَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ‌ۖ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"يَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>أَيُّهَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لِمَ تَقُولُونَ مَا لَا تَفْعَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"كَبُرَ مَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>تًا عِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ند</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َقُولُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مَا لَا تَفْعَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ يُحِبُّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ يُقَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِلُونَ فِى سَبِيلِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> صَف<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ًّا ك</span>َأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ُنْيَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نٌ م</span>َّرْص<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>صٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"وَإِذْ قَالَ مُوسَىٰ لِقَوْمِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> يَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>قَوْمِ لِمَ 